# One reason per line of capture-v2-invalid.jsonl, in order (lines starting with # are skipped).
# Each reason is a substring of that line's refusal.
a followers record needs v 2
a tagged record needs v 2
a comment account fails coffee-words@1
comment text must be at most 300 characters
posts must be at most 12
comments must be at most 50 per post
code must be a post code
via must be usertag or mention
a comment appears twice in a post
a kept account appears twice
a list stopped by a wall is not complete
